ts'>еЉ иј‰дё­...</span></div><div class='grid'>␀</style></head><body><div class='wrap'><h1>M5stack Tab5ењЁз·љжЋ§е€¶йќўжќї</h1><p class='sub'>йЃёж“‡дёЂеЂ‹еЉџиѓЅй–‹е§‹дЅїз”Ё</p><div class='cards'>␀␀<a class='card' href='/sysinfo'><div class='ci s'><svg viewBox='0 0 48 48' fill='none'><rect x='8' y='8' width='32' height='32' rx='5' fill='#B2F5EA' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3'/><path d='M24 16v8' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='24' cy='32' r='2.5' fill='#36527C'/></svg></div><h2>иЁ­е‚™дїЎжЃЇ</h2><p>жџҐзњ‹зі»зµ±з‹Ђж…‹гЂЃз¶ІзµЎгЂЃе…§е­е’Њ TF еЌЎдїЎжЃЇ</p></a>␀␀<a class='card' href='/webfm'><div class='ci f'><svg viewBox='0 0 48 48' fill='none'><path d='M32 6H22V42H32V6Z' fill='#FFE08A' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M42 6H32V42H42V6Z' fill='#FFE08A' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M10 6L18 7L14.5 42L6 41L10 6Z' fill='#FFE08A' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg></div><h2>ж–‡д»¶з®Ўзђ†</h2><p>зЂЏи¦ЅгЂЃдёЉе‚ігЂЃдё‹иј‰е’Њз®Ўзђ†е„Іе­иЈќзЅ®дё­зљ„ж–‡д»¶</p></a>␀␀␀␀<div class='card'><h3>зі»зµ±ж¦‚и¦Ѕ</h3><div id='c_sys'></div></div><div class='card'><h3>з¶ІзµЎз‹Ђж…‹</h3><div id='c_net'></div></div><div class='card'><h3>е…§е­дїЎжЃЇ</h3><div id='c_mem'></div></div><div class='card'><h3>TF еЌЎ</h3><div id='c_tf'></div></div><div class='card'><h3>жќїиј‰иЁ­е‚™</h3><div id='c_board'></div></div>␀␀<div id='file_modal' class='modal-overlay'><div class='modal-box'><div class='modal-header'><span>ж–°е»єж–‡д»¶</span><span class='modal-close' onclick='closeFileModal()'>&times;</span></div><div class='modal-body'><p class='hint'>и«‹ијёе…Ґж–°ж–‡д»¶еђЌзЁ±пјљ</p><input id='filename' type='text' placeholder='new.txt' style='width:100%' onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter')newFile()\"></div><div class='modal-footer'><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='closeFileModal()'>еЏ–ж¶€</button><button onclick='newFile()'>зўєиЄЌе‰µе»є</button></div></div></div>␀␀␀<div id='move_modal' class='modal-overlay'><div class='modal-box'><div class='modal-header'><span>з§»е‹•: <span id='moveName'></span></span><span class='modal-close' onclick='closeMoveModal()'>&times;</span></div><div class='modal-body'><div class='hint' style='margin-bottom:10px'>з›®жЁ™з›®йЊ„: <b id='movePath'>/</b></div><div id='treeRootLabel' class='tree-label selected' onclick='selectMoveDir(\"\")'><span class='tree-arrow'>&#9660;</span><span style='font-weight:800'>/ (ж №з›®йЊ„)</span></div><div id='treeRoot' class='tree-children'></div></div><div class='modal-footer'><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='closeMoveModal()'>еЏ–ж¶€</button><button onclick='confirmMove()'>зўєиЄЌз§»е‹•</button></div></div></div>␀<div id='upload_modal' class='modal-overlay'><div class='modal-box'><div class='modal-header'><span>дёЉе‚іж–‡д»¶</span><span class='modal-close' onclick='closeUploadModal()'>&times;</span></div><div class='modal-body'><p class='hint'>йЃёж“‡дёЂеЂ‹ж€–е¤љеЂ‹ж–‡д»¶дёЉе‚іе€°з•¶е‰Ќз›®йЊ„пјљ</p><input id='file' type='file' multiple style='width:100%'><div id='uploadStatus' class='hint' style='margin-top:12px'></div></div><div class='modal-footer'><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='closeUploadModal()'>еЏ–ж¶€</button><button onclick='upload()'>й–‹е§‹дёЉе‚і</button></div></div></div>␀␀␀␀<title>M5stack Tab5ењЁз·љжЋ§е€¶йќўжќї</title><style>␀␀␀␀<title>ењ–з‰‡жџҐзњ‹е™Ё</title><style>␀␀␀<title>иЁ­е‚™дїЎжЃЇ - ESP32-P4</title><style>␀␀␀BMP еѓЏзґ и®ЂеЏ–е¤±ж•—␀␀BMP е°єеЇёз„Ўж•€␀␀␀␀BMP ж–‡д»¶й ­з„Ўж•€␀BMP ж–‡д»¶з„Ўжі•и®ЂеЏ–␀␀BMP ж јејЏжљ«дёЌж”ЇжЊЃ␀␀BMP и§Јзўј + PPA й ђи¦ЅйЎЇз¤є␀␀␀BMP и§Јзўје…§е­дёЌи¶і␀␀BMP и§Јзўјй ђи¦ЅйЎЇз¤є␀␀BMP й ђи¦Ѕзё®ж”ѕе…§е­дёЌи¶і␀␀␀␀CPU й »зЋ‡␀␀DMA е…§е­з·ЉејµпјЊжљ«дёЌи§Јзўј␀FLAC йњЂи¦Ѓ ESP-ADF и§Јзўје™Ё␀␀␀HiFi 2 йЂљйЃ“йџій »з·Ёи§Јзўјпј€ж’­ж”ѕ + йЊ„йџіпј‰␀␀␀IOж“ґе±•е™Ёв‘ ␀␀IOж“ґе±•е™Ёв‘Ў␀␀JPEG й ­и§Јжћђе¤±ж•—пјЊж”№з”Ё LVGL и§Јзўје™Ё␀␀␀␀JPEG ж–‡д»¶йЃЋе¤§ж€–з„Ўжі•и®ЂеЏ–пјЊж”№з”Ё LVGL и§Јзўје™Ё␀␀␀␀JPEG йЎЇз¤єз·©е­дёЌи¶іпјЊж”№з”Ё LVGL и§Јзўје™Ё␀JPEG зЎ¬д»¶и§Јзўј + PPA й ђи¦ЅйЎЇз¤є␀␀␀␀JPEG зЎ¬д»¶и§Јзўј + и»џд»¶зё®ж”ѕй ђи¦ЅйЎЇз¤є␀␀␀␀JPEG зЎ¬д»¶и§Јзўје¤±ж•—пјЊж”№з”Ё LVGL и§Јзўје™Ё␀JPEG зЎ¬д»¶и§Јзўје°єеЇёз•°еёёпјЊж”№з”Ё LVGL и§Јзўје™Ё␀␀␀JPEG зё®ж”ѕй ђи¦Ѕе…§е­дёЌи¶і␀␀␀JPEG и»џд»¶зё®ж”ѕи§Јзўјжє–е‚™е¤±ж•—␀JPEG и»џд»¶зё®ж”ѕи§Јзўје¤±ж•—␀␀␀JPEG и»џд»¶и§Јзўј + PPA й ђи¦ЅйЎЇз¤є␀␀␀␀JPEG и»џд»¶и§ЈзўјжњЄе•“з”ЁпјЊDMA е…§е­з·Љејµ␀␀␀JPEG и»џд»¶и§Јзўјй ђи¦ЅйЎЇз¤є␀␀␀JPEG ијёе‡єе…§е­дёЌи¶іпјЊж”№з”Ё LVGL и§Јзўје™Ё␀JPEG й ђи¦Ѕе…§е­дёЌи¶іпјЊжњЄе•“з”Ёзё®ж”ѕи§Јзўје™Ё␀␀MP3 йњЂи¦Ѓ ESP-ADF и§Јзўје™Ё␀␀␀␀PPA SRM е·Іе°±з·’␀␀␀RTC ж™‚йђпјЊж”ЇжЊЃе®љж™‚дё­ж–·е–љй†’␀␀␀SSH е·Іж–·й–‹␀␀␀SSH жњЌе‹™е™Ё␀␀␀SSH йЂЈжЋҐе¤±ж•—␀␀␀␀TF еЌЎдё­зљ„еЌ‡зґљеЊ…и€‡з•¶е‰Ќз‰€жњ¬з›ёеђЊпјЊе·ІеїЅз•ҐгЂ‚␀␀␀TF еЌЎдё­зљ„еЌ‡зґљеЊ…з‰€жњ¬ијѓи€ЉпјЊе·ІеїЅз•ҐгЂ‚␀␀␀␀TF еЌЎе‰©й¤з©єй–“дёЌи¶і 20MB␀␀␀TF еЌЎжњЄжЋ›иј‰␀TFеЌЎжњЄжЋ›иј‰␀␀Tab5 жќїиј‰ I2C иЁ­е‚™␀␀UPLOAD дё‹иј‰е¤±ж•—пјљHTTP %d␀␀␀UPLOAD дё‹иј‰и®ЂеЏ–е¤±ж•—пјљerrno=%d␀␀␀␀UPLOAD дё‹иј‰йЂЈжЋҐй•·ж™‚й–“з„Ўж•ёж“љ␀␀␀UPLOAD е›єд»¶ SHA256 ж Ўй©—е¤±ж•—␀␀␀UPLOAD е›єд»¶
з•¶е‰Ќз‰€жњ¬пјљ%s
жњЂж–°з‰€жњ¬пјљ%s  %s␀␀␀UPLOAD е›єд»¶
з•¶е‰Ќз‰€жњ¬пјљ--
жњЂж–°з‰€жњ¬пјљ--␀␀␀UPLOAD е›єд»¶дё‹иј‰е…§е­дёЌи¶і␀UPLOAD е›єд»¶дё‹иј‰еЏѓж•ёз„Ўж•€␀UPLOAD е›єд»¶йЃЋе¤§пјљ%llu > %lu␀␀␀␀USB-C + й›»ж± е……й›»␀␀␀␀USB-C + й›»ж± еѕ…ж©џ␀␀␀␀USB-C е¤–йѓЁдѕ›й›»␀␀WAV ж•ёж“ље®љдЅЌе¤±ж•—␀␀WAV ж–‡д»¶й ­з„Ўж•€␀WAV з·Ёзўјжљ«дёЌж”ЇжЊЃ␀␀WIFIе·ІйЂЈжЋҐпјЊеЏЇй–‹е•“ењЁз·љж–‡д»¶з®Ўзђ†е™Ё␀␀Webе·Із€Іж’­ж”ѕжљ«еЃњ␀␀␀WiFi IPv4 жњЄйЂЈжЋҐ␀WiFi ењЁз·љж–‡д»¶з®Ўзђ†е™Ё␀␀WiFi е¤©з·ље€‡жЏ›гЂЃе–‡еЏ­дЅїиѓЅгЂЃLCD еѕ©дЅЌгЂЃи§ёж‘ёеѕ©дЅЌгЂЃж”ќеѓЏй ­еѕ©дЅЌгЂЃиЂіж©џжЄўжё¬␀␀␀WiFi жњЄйЂЈжЋҐ␀␀WiFi й›»жєђгЂЃUSB 5V ијёе‡єгЂЃй—њж©џи„€иЎќгЂЃеї«е……дЅїиѓЅгЂЃе……й›»з‹Ђж…‹гЂЃе……й›»дЅїиѓЅ␀
[31m[йЊЇиЄ¤] SSH йЂЈжЋҐе¤±ж•—гЂ‚[0m
␀␀␀async function cp(p){try{let d=prompt('и¤‡иЈЅе€°ж–‡д»¶е¤ѕпј€з›ёе°Ќз•¶е‰ЌзЈЃзўџпј‰',dir);if(d===null)return;await api('/webfm/copy',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:'path='+enc(p)+'&dest='+enc(d)});load()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}␀␀␀async function del(p){try{if(!confirm('зўєе®ље€Єй™¤ '+p+' е—Ћпјџ'))return;await api('/webfm/delete',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:'path='+enc(p)});load()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}␀␀async function edit(p){try{editPath=p;el('editName').textContent=p;let r=await fetch('/webfm/read?path='+enc(p));let t=await r.text();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(t||r.status);let code=r.headers.get('X-Text-Encoding')||'UTF-8';el('editEncoding').textContent='з·Ёзўј: '+code+(code.startsWith('UTF-8')?'':'пјЊдїќе­еѕЊиЅ‰з€І UTF-8');el('editText').value=t;el('editor').classList.add('active');el('editText').focus()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}␀async function load(){try{status('ж­ЈењЁеЉ иј‰...');let r=await fetch('/webfm/list?dir='+enc(dir));if(!r.ok)throw new Error(await r.text()||r.status);let j=await r.json();items=j.items||[];items.sort((a,b)=>b.dir-a.dir||a.name.localeCompare(b.name));if(items.length&&kbActive&&sel<0)sel=0;if(sel>=items.length)sel=items.length-1;el('path').textContent='/' + dir;history.replaceState(null,'','/webfm'+(dir?'?dir='+enc(dir):''));render()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}␀␀␀async function ren(p){try{let n=prompt('ж–°еђЌзЁ±',p.split('/').pop());if(!n)return;await api('/webfm/rename',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:'path='+enc(p)+'&name='+enc(n)});load()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}␀␀␀␀async function upload(){let fs=[...el('file').files];if(!fs.length)return;try{let ok=0;for(let i=0;i<fs.length;i++){await uploadOne(fs[i],i,fs.length);ok++;await upSleep(180)}el('uploadStatus').textContent=`дёЉе‚іе®Њж€ђпјљ${ok}/${fs.length}`;setTimeout(()=>{closeUploadModal();load()},500)}catch(e){status(e.message,true);el('uploadStatus').textContent=e.message}}␀␀␀␀async function uploadOne(f,i,n){if(f.size===0){await uploadFetch('/webfm/upload?dir='+enc(dir)+'&name='+enc(f.name)+'&offset=0&total=0',new Blob([]),f.name);return}for(let off=0;off<f.size;off+=UP_CHUNK){let end=Math.min(f.size,off+UP_CHUNK),part=f.slice(off,end),pct=Math.floor(end*100/f.size);el('uploadStatus').textContent=`ж­ЈењЁдёЉе‚і (${i+1}/${n}) ${pct}% ${f.name}`;await uploadFetch('/webfm/upload?dir='+enc(dir)+'&name='+enc(f.name)+'&offset='+off+'&total='+f.size,part,f.name);await upSleep(30)}}␀␀function ext(n){let i=n.lastIndexOf('.');return i<0?'':n.slice(i+1).toLowerCase()}function isImg(n){return ['jpg','jpeg','png','gif','bmp'].includes(ext(n))}function isText(n){return ['txt','log','md','json','ini','cfg','conf','csv','c','h','cpp','hpp','py','js','html','css','xml','yaml','yml'].includes(ext(n))}function kind(it){if(it.dir)return['ж–‡д»¶е¤ѕ','dir',icoDir()];let e=ext(it.name);if(isImg(it.name))return['ењ–з‰‡','image',icoImg()];if(['mp3','wav','flac','aac','ogg'].includes(e))return['йџій »','audio',icoAud()];if(['mp4','avi','mov','mkv'].includes(e))return['и¦–й »','video',icoVid()];if(['zip','gz','tar','rar','7z'].includes(e))return['еЈ“зё®еЊ…','archive',icoArc()];if(isText(it.name))return[e||'ж–‡жњ¬','code',icoCode()];return[e||'ж–‡д»¶','',icoFile()]}␀␀␀function pager(tp){let html=`<button ${page<=1?'disabled':''} onclick='goPage(1)'>й¦–й Ѓ</button><button ${page<=1?'disabled':''} onclick='goPage(page-1)'>дёЉдёЂй Ѓ</button>`;let b=Math.max(1,page-2),e=Math.min(tp,page+2);for(let p=b;p<=e;p++)html+=`<button class='${p===page?'active':''}' onclick='goPage(${p})'>${p}</button>`;html+=`<button ${page>=tp?'disabled':''} onclick='goPage(page+1)'>дё‹дёЂй Ѓ</button><button ${page>=tp?'disabled':''} onclick='goPage(${tp})'>жњ«й Ѓ</button>`;el('topPager').innerHTML=tp>1?html:'';el('bottomPager').innerHTML=tp>1?html:''}function goPage(p){page=p;if(items.length)sel=Math.min((page-1)*pageSize,items.length-1);render();syncSel(true)}␀␀function refresh(){fetch('/api/sysinfo').then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{c_sys.innerHTML=R('иЉЇз‰‡ећ‹и™џ',d.chip)+R('IDF з‰€жњ¬',d.idf_ver)+R('CPU й »зЋ‡',d.cpu_mhz+' MHz')+R('Flash',d.flash_mb+' MB')+R('йЃ‹иЎЊж™‚й–“',d.uptime);c_net.innerHTML=R('WiFi з‹Ђж…‹',d.wifi_status)+R('SSID',d.wifi_ssid)+R('IPv4',d.wifi_ipv4)+R('IPv6',d.wifi_ipv6)+R('RSSI',d.wifi_rssi)+R('дїЎйЃ“',d.wifi_channel);c_mem.innerHTML=R('DRAM еЏЇз”Ё',d.heap_dram_free_kb+' KB')+R('DRAM зёЅиЁ€',d.heap_dram_total_kb+' KB')+R('DMA еЏЇз”Ё',d.dma_free_kb+' KB')+R('DMA зёЅиЁ€',d.dma_total_kb+' KB')+R('PSRAM еЏЇз”Ё',d.psram_free_kb+' KB')+R('PSRAM зёЅиЁ€',d.psram_total_kb+' KB');c_tf.innerHTML=lines(d.tf_text);c_board.innerHTML=lines(d.board_text);ts.textContent=new Date().toLocaleTimeString()+' е·Іж›ґж–°'}).catch(()=>{ts.textContent='йЂЈжЋҐе¤±ж•—'})}refresh();setInterval(refresh,2000);␀␀␀function render(){let total=items.length,tp=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(total/pageSize));if(total&&kbActive&&sel<0)sel=0;if(sel>=total)sel=total-1;if(!total)sel=-1;if(page>tp)page=tp;let start=(page-1)*pageSize,show=items.slice(start,start+pageSize),h='';show.forEach((it,local)=>{let i=start+local,p=full(it),k=kind(it);h+=`<tr data-i='${i}' class='${kbActive&&i===sel?'kb-focus':''}'><td><div class='name-cell'><span class='file-icon'>${k[2]}</span><div class='name-meta'><button class='name-title' data-act='open' data-i='${i}'>${esc(it.name)}</button><span class='name-sub'>/${esc(p)}</span></div></div></td><td><span class='chip ${k[1]}'>${k[0]}</span></td><td>${it.dir?'-':fmt(it.size)}</td><td><div class='actions'><button class='btn-secondary' data-act='open' data-i='${i}'>ж‰“й–‹</button>`;if(!it.dir){h+=`<a class='btn' href='/webfm/download?path=${enc(p)}'>дё‹иј‰</a>`}h+=`<button class='btn-secondary' data-act='rename' data-i='${i}'>ж”№еђЌ</button><button class='btn-secondary' data-act='copy' data-i='${i}'>и¤‡иЈЅ</button><button class='btn-secondary' data-act='move' data-i='${i}'>з§»е‹•</button><button class='btn-danger' data-act='delete' data-i='${i}'>е€Єй™¤</button></div></td></tr>`});el('rows').innerHTML=h||\"<tr><td colspan='4' class='hint'>ж­¤ж–‡д»¶е¤ѕз€Із©єгЂ‚</td></tr>\";el('pageInfo').textContent=`е…± ${total} й …пјЊжЇЏй Ѓ ${pageSize} й …пјЊз¬¬ ${page}/${tp} й Ѓ`;pager(tp);status(total+' й …')}␀␀␀function selectMoveDir(d){moveSelectedDir=d;document.querySelectorAll('#move_modal .tree-label.selected').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('selected'));if(d==='')el('treeRootLabel').classList.add('selected');el('movePath').textContent='/' + d}async function openMoveModal(p,name){moveTarget=p;moveSelectedDir='';el('moveName').textContent=name;selectMoveDir('');el('move_modal').classList.add('active');await loadTree(el('treeRoot'),'')}function closeMoveModal(){el('move_modal').classList.remove('active');moveTarget=''}async function loadTree(c,d){c.innerHTML='<span class=\"hint\">еЉ иј‰дё­...</span>';try{let r=await fetch('/webfm/dirtree?dir='+enc(d));let j=await r.json(),dirs=j.dirs||[];c.innerHTML='';if(!dirs.length){c.innerHTML='<span class=\"hint\">(з©є)</span>';return}dirs.forEach(name=>{let fp=d?d+'/'+name:name,n=document.createElement('div'),l=document.createElement('div'),ch=document.createElement('div');l.className='tree-label';l.innerHTML='<span class=\"tree-arrow\">&#9654;</span><span>'+esc(name)+'</span>';ch.className='tree-children';ch.style.display='none';let loaded=false;l.onclick=async e=>{e.stopPropagation();selectMoveDir(fp);l.classList.add('selected');if(!loaded){loaded=true;await loadTree(ch,fp)}let vis=ch.style.display!=='none';ch.style.display=vis?'none':'block';l.querySelector('.tree-arrow').innerHTML=vis?'&#9654;':'&#9660;'};n.appendChild(l);n.appendChild(ch);c.appendChild(n)})}catch(e){c.innerHTML='<span class=\"err\">еЉ иј‰е¤±ж•—</span>'}}async function confirmMove(){if(!moveTarget)return;try{await api('/webfm/move',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:'path='+enc(moveTarget)+'&dest