Ђ‰ж‹©дёЂдёЄеЉџиѓЅејЂе§‹дЅїз”Ё</p><div class='cards'><a class='card' href='/webfm'><div class='ci f'><svg viewBox='0 0 48 48' fill='none'><path d='M32 6H22V42H32V6Z' fill='#FFE08A' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M42 6H32V42H42V6Z' fill='#FFE08A' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M10 6L18 7L14.5 42L6 41L10 6Z' fill='#FFE08A' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg></div><h2>ж–‡д»¶з®Ўзђ†</h2><p>жµЏи§€гЂЃдёЉдј гЂЃдё‹иЅЅе’Њз®Ўзђ†е­е‚Ёе™Ёдё­зљ„ж–‡д»¶</p></a><a class='card' href='/sysinfo'><div class='ci s'><svg viewBox='0 0 48 48' fill='none'><rect x='8' y='8' width='32' height='32' rx='5' fill='#B2F5EA' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3'/><path d='M24 16v8' stroke='#36527C' stroke-width='3' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='24' cy='32' r='2.5' fill='#36527C'/></svg></div><h2>и®ѕе¤‡дїЎжЃЇ</h2><p>жџҐзњ‹зі»з»џзЉ¶жЂЃгЂЃзЅ‘з»њгЂЃе†…е­е’Њ TF еЌЎдїЎжЃЇ</p></a></div></div></body></html>␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><link rel='icon' href='/favicon.ico' type='image/svg+xml'><title>и®ѕе¤‡дїЎжЃЇ - ESP32-P4</title><style>:root{--ink:#20324a;--muted:#6d7f96;--line:#d9e2ec;--accent:#2f6fed}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:18px;background:radial-gradient(circle at top left,#f8fbff,#e8eef6 42%,#dde7f2 100%);font-family:'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}.shell{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:20px}.top a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent);font-size:14px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef4ff}.top h1{margin:0;font-size:26px;flex:1;letter-spacing:0}.badge{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);background:#f0f4f8;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.85);border:1px solid rgba(217,226,236,.9);border-radius:18px;padding:20px 22px;box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(40,72,112,.08)}.card h3{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:16px;color:var(--accent);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f4f8;font-size:14px}.row:last-child{border-bottom:none}.rl{color:var(--muted)}.rv{font-weight:600;text-align:right;word-break:break-all}@media(max-width:760px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top{flex-wrap:wrap}}</style></head><body><div class='shell'><div class='top'><a href='/'>&#8592; иї”е›ћ</a><h1>и®ѕе¤‡дїЎжЃЇ</h1><span class='badge' id='ts'>еЉ иЅЅдё­...</span></div><div class='grid'><div class='card'><h3>зі»з»џж¦‚и§€</h3><div id='c_sys'></div></div><div class='card'><h3>зЅ‘з»њзЉ¶жЂЃ</h3><div id='c_net'></div></div><div class='card'><h3>е†…е­дїЎжЃЇ</h3><div id='c_mem'></div></div><div class='card'><h3>TF еЌЎ</h3><div id='c_tf'></div></div><div class='card'><h3>жќїиЅЅи®ѕе¤‡</h3><div id='c_board'></div></div></div></div><script>function esc(s){return String(s==null?'-':s).replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;')}function R(l,v){return '<div class="row"><span class="rl">'+esc(l)+'</span><span class="rv">'+esc(v)+'</span></div>'}function lines(t){return String(t||'').split('\n').filter(x=>x.trim()).map(x=>{let i=x.indexOf(': ');return i>0?R(x.slice(0,i),x.slice(i+2)):R(x,'')}).join('')}function refresh(){fetch('/api/sysinfo').then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{c_sys.innerHTML=R('иЉЇз‰‡ећ‹еЏ·',d.chip)+R('IDF з‰€жњ¬',d.idf_ver)+R('CPU йў‘зЋ‡',d.cpu_mhz+' MHz')+R('Flash',d.flash_mb+' MB')+R('иїђиЎЊж—¶й—ґ',d.uptime);c_net.innerHTML=R('WiFi зЉ¶жЂЃ',d.wifi_status)+R('SSID',d.wifi_ssid)+R('IPv4',d.wifi_ipv4)+R('IPv6',d.wifi_ipv6)+R('RSSI',d.wifi_rssi)+R('дїЎйЃ“',d.wifi_channel);c_mem.innerHTML=R('DRAM еЏЇз”Ё',d.heap_dram_free_kb+' KB')+R('DRAM жЂ»и®Ў',d.heap_dram_total_kb+' KB')+R('DMA еЏЇз”Ё',d.dma_free_kb+' KB')+R('DMA жЂ»и®Ў',d.dma_total_kb+' KB')+R('PSRAM еЏЇз”Ё',d.psram_free_kb+' KB')+R('PSRAM жЂ»и®Ў',d.psram_total_kb+' KB');c_tf.innerHTML=lines(d.tf_text);c_board.innerHTML=lines(d.board_text);ts.textContent=new Date().toLocaleTimeString()+' е·Іж›ґж–°'}).catch(()=>{ts.textContent='иїћжЋҐе¤±иґҐ'})}refresh();setInterval(refresh,2000);</script></body></html>␀␀␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><link rel='icon' href='/favicon.ico' type='image/svg+xml'><title>ESP32 ењЁзєїж–‡д»¶з®Ўзђ†</title><style>:root{--ink:#20324a;--muted:#6d7f96;--line:#d9e2ec;--accent:#2f6fed;--danger:#d4380d;--soft:#eef4ff}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:18px;background:radial-gradient(circle at top left,#f8fbff,#e8eef6 42%,#dde7f2 100%);font-family:'Segoe UI','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px}.shell{max-width:1220px;margin:0 auto;background:rgba(255,255,255,.84);border:1px solid rgba(217,226,236,.92);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(40,72,112,.14);overflow:hidden}.hero{padding:24px 24px 12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7fbff 0%,#edf5ff 55%,#f7fffd 100%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hero h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:0}.hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;word-break:break-all}.toolbar,.uploadbar{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;padding:16px 24px 0}.stats{padding:0 24px 10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.grow{flex:1}.table-wrap{padding:0 24px 18px;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden}.selectionbar{display:none;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:10px 24px 0;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#f8fbff}.selectionbar.active{display:flex}.sel-count{font-weight:800;color:var(--ink)}table{width:100%;min-width:940px;table-layout:auto;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 10px}th{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;text-align:left;padding:0 12px 6px}th:nth-child(2),td:nth-child(2){width:96px}th:nth-child(3),td:nth-child(3){width:112px}th:nth-child(4),td:nth-child(4){min-width:500px;width:44%}td{height:auto;min-height:78px;background:#fff;padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #edf2f7;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;vertical-align:middle;overflow:visible}td:first-child{min-width:280px;border-left:1px solid #edf2f7;border-radius:14px 0 0 14px}td:last-child{border-right:1px solid #edf2f7;border-radius:0 14px 14px 0}.name-cell{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-width:0;min-height:56px;overflow:hidden}.pick{display:none;width:18px;height:18px;flex:none;accent-color:var(--accent)}tbody.multi .pick{display:inline-block}.file-icon{width:24px;height:24px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none}.file-icon svg{width:24px;height:24px;display:block}.name-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-width:0;min-height:56px;overflow:hidden}.name-title{font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;max-height:2.8em;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;white-space:normal;word-break:break-all;overflow:hidden;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;background:transparent;border:0;padding:1px 0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.name-sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:68px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#eef4ff;color:#2451a6;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.chip.dir{background:#fff5d9;color:#9a6700}.chip.image{background:#eef7ff;color:#1d5fd0}.chip.audio{background:#e8fcfa;color:#0e7a7a}.chip.video{background:#fff1f0;color:#b42318}.chip.archive{background:#fff7e6;color:#ad6800}.chip.code{background:#f0f5ff;color:#1d39c4}.btn,button{font:inherit;border:none;border-radius:12px;padding:9px 12px;min-height:38px;background:#2f6fed;color:#fff;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;white-space:nowrap;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,#3a7cff,#245bda)}.btn:hover,button:hover{filter:brightness(1.03)}button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}.btn-secondary{background-image:none;background:#eef4ff;color:#2451a6}.btn-danger{background-image:none;background:#fff1f0;color:#b42318}.actions{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;overflow:visible;white-space:normal;min-width:0}.actions>*{flex:0 0 auto}.hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.err{color:var(--danger)}tbody tr.kb-focus td{box-shadow:inset 0 2px 0 var(--accent),inset 0 -2px 0 var(--accent);background:#f8fbff}tbody tr.kb-focus td:first-child{box-shadow:inset 2px 0 0 var(--accent),inset 0 2px 0 var(--accent),inset 0 -2px 0 var(--accent)}tbody tr.kb-focus td:last-child{box-shadow:inset -2px 0 0 var(--accent),inset 0 2px 0 var(--accent),inset 0 -2px 0 var(--accent)}.pagination,.bottom-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 24px 18px}.pagination button{padding:7px 11px;background-image:none;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}.pagination button.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}.pagination button:disabled{color:var(--muted);background:#f7f9fc;cursor:not-allowed}.page-info{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}input[type=text],input[type=file]{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font:inherit}input[type=text]{min-width:180px}.editor{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);display:none;z-index:1001;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px}.editor.active{display:flex}.editor-panel{width:min(1100px,96vw);height:min(760px,88vh);background:#fff;border:1px solid #edf2f7;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.2);display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:14px}.editor textarea{flex:1;width:100%;min-height:0;resize:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;font:14px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#1f2f46;background:#fbfdff}.modal-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);display:none;z-index:1000;justify-content:center;align-items:center}.modal-overlay.active{display:flex}.modal-box{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;width:92%;max-width:480px;max-height:80vh;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}.modal-header{padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:800;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.modal-close{cursor:pointer;font-size:20px;color:var(--muted);padding:4px}.modal-body{padding:16px 20px;overflow-y:auto;flex:1}.modal-footer{padding:12px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end}.tree-label{cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;user-select:none}.tree-label:hover{background:#eef4ff}.tree-label.selected{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}.tree-children{padding-left:18px}.tree-arrow{width:14px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;flex:none}@media(max-width:900px){body{padding:10px}.shell{border-radius:16px}.hero{padding:18px}.toolbar,.table-wrap{padding-left:14px;padding-right:14px}.selectionbar{margin-left:14px;margin-right:14px}.table-wrap{overflow:visible}table,thead,tbody,tr,th,td{display:block}table{min-width:0;border-spacing:0}thead{display:none}tr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #edf2f7;border-radius:14px}tbody tr.kb-focus{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}tbody tr.kb-focus td,tbody tr.kb-focus td:first-child,tbody tr.kb-focus td:last-child{box-shadow:none;background:transparent}td{width:100%!important;height:auto;min-height:0;border:0!important;border-radius:0!important;background:transparent;padding:0;overflow:visible}td:first-child{grid-column:1;min-width:0}td:nth-child(2){grid-column:2;align-self:center}td:nth-child(3){grid-column:1/-1;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}td:nth-child(3):before{content:'е¤§е°Џ: '}td:nth-child(4){grid-column:1/-1}.name-cell,.name-meta{min-height:0;overflow:visible}.name-title{display:block;max-height:none;-webkit-line-clamp:unset}.name-sub{white-space:normal;word-break:break-all}.actions{justify-content:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;overflow:visible;padding-bottom:0}.modal-box{width:96%}}</style></head><body><div class='shell'><div class='hero'><h1>ESP32 ењЁзєїж–‡д»¶з®Ўзђ†</h1><p>еЅ“е‰Ќз›®еЅ•: <span id='path'>/</span></p></div><div class='toolbar'><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='up()'>иї”е›ћдёЉзє§</button><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='load()'>е€·ж–°</button><button class='btn-secondary' id='multiBtn' onclick='toggleMulti()'>е¤љйЂ‰</button><div class='grow'></div><button onclick='openMkdirModal()'>ж–°е»єз›®еЅ•</button><button onclick='openFileModal()'>ж–°е»єж–‡д»¶</button><button onclick='openUploadModal()'>дёЉдј ж–‡д»¶</button></div><div class='selectionbar' id='selbar'><span class='sel-count' id='selCount'>0 йЎ№е·ІйЂ‰</span><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='selectAllItems()'>е…ЁйЂ‰</button><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='copySelected(false)'>е¤Ќе€¶ж‰ЂйЂ‰</button><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='copySelected(true)'>е‰Єе€‡</button><button class='btn-secondary' id='pasteBtn' onclick='pasteClip()'>зІиґґ</button><button class='btn-danger' onclick='deleteSelected()'>е€ й™¤ж‰ЂйЂ‰</button><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='clearSelection()'>еЏ–ж¶€йЂ‰ж‹©</button></div><div class='stats'><span id='status'>ж­ЈењЁеЉ иЅЅ...</span></div><div class='pagination' id='topPager'></div><div class='table-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th>еђЌз§°</th><th>з±»ећ‹</th><th>е¤§е°Џ</th><th>ж“ЌдЅњ</th></tr></thead><tbody id='rows'></tbody></table></div><div class='bottom-bar'><span class='page-info' id='pageInfo'></span><div class='pagination' id='bottomPager'></div></div><div class='editor' id='editor'><div class='editor-panel'><div class='toolbar' style='padding:0 0 12px'><strong id='editName'></strong><span id='editEncoding' class='hint'></span><div class='grow'></div><button onclick='saveEdit()'>дїќе­</button><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='closeEdit()'>е…ій—­</button></div><textarea id='editText'></textarea></div></div><div id='mkdir_modal' class='modal-overlay'><div class='modal-box'><div class='modal-header'><span>ж–°е»єз›®еЅ•</span><span class='modal-close' onclick='closeMkdirModal()'>&times;</span></div><div class='modal-body'><p class='hint'>иЇ·иѕ“е…Ґж–°з›®еЅ•еђЌз§°пјљ</p><input id='dirname' type='text' placeholder='з›®еЅ•еђЌз§°' style='width:100%' onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')mkdir()"></div><div class='modal-footer'><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='closeMkdirModal()'>еЏ–ж¶€</button><button onclick='mkdir()'>зЎ®и®¤е€›е»є</button></div></div></div><div id='file_modal' class='modal-overlay'><div class='modal-box'><div class='modal-header'><span>ж–°е»єж–‡д»¶</span><span class='modal-close' onclick='closeFileModal()'>&times;</span></div><div class='modal-body'><p class='hint'>иЇ·иѕ“е…Ґж–°ж–‡д»¶еђЌз§°пјљ</p><input id='filename' type='text' placeholder='new.txt' style='width:100%' onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')newFile()"></div><div class='modal-footer'><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='closeFileModal()'>еЏ–ж¶€</button><button onclick='newFile()'>зЎ®и®¤е€›е»є</button></div></div></div><div id='upload_modal' class='modal-overlay'><div class='modal-box'><div class='modal-header'><span>дёЉдј ж–‡д»¶</span><span class='modal-close' onclick='closeUploadModal()'>&times;</span></div><div class='modal-body'><p class='hint'>йЂ‰ж‹©дёЂдёЄж€–е¤љдёЄж–‡д»¶дёЉдј е€°еЅ“е‰Ќз›®еЅ•пјљ</p><input id='file' type='file' multiple style='width:100%'><div id='uploadStatus' class='hint' style='margin-top:12px'></div></div><div class='modal-footer'><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='closeUploadModal()'>еЏ–ж¶€</button><button onclick='upload()'>ејЂе§‹дёЉдј </button></div></div></div><div id='move_modal' class='modal-overlay'><div class='modal-box'><div class='modal-header'><span><span id='moveTitle'>з§»еЉЁ</span>: <span id='moveName'></span></span><span class='modal-close' onclick='closeMoveModal()'>&times;</span></div><div class='modal-body'><div class='hint' style='margin-bottom:10px'>з›®ж ‡з›®еЅ•: <b id='movePath'>/</b></div><div id='treeRootLabel' class='tree-label selected' onclick='selectMoveDir("")'><span class='tree-arrow'>&#9660;</span><span style='font-weight:800'>/ (ж №з›®еЅ•)</span></div><div id='treeRoot' class='tree-children'></div></div><div class='modal-footer'><button class='btn-secondary' onclick='closeMoveModal()'>еЏ–ж¶€</button><button id='moveConfirm' onclick='confirmMove()'>зЎ®и®¤з§»еЉЁ</button></div></div></div><script>let dir=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('dir')||'',items=[],editPath='',page=1,pageSize=20,sel=-1,kbActive=false,moveTarget='',moveSelectedDir='',moveMode='move',multi=false,selected=new Set(),clip=[],clipMode='copy';const el=id=>document.getElementById(id);function status(t,err=false){el('status').textContent=t;el('status').className=err?'err':''}const enc=encodeURIComponent;const esc=s=>String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));function full(it){return (dir?dir+'/':'')+it.name}function fmt(n){if(!n)return'';let u=['B','KB','MB','GB'],i=0,v=n;while(v>=1024&&i<u.length-1){v/=1024;i++}return(i?v.toFixed(1):v)+' '+u[i]}function ext(n){let i=n.lastIndexOf('.');return i<0?'':n.slice(i+1).toLowerCase()}function isImg(n){return ['jpg','jpeg','png','gif','bmp'].includes(ext(n))}function isText(n){return ['txt','log','md','json','ini','cfg','conf','csv','c','h','cpp','hpp','py','js','html','css','xml','yaml','yml'].includes(ext(n))}function kind(it){if(it.dir)return['ж–‡д»¶е¤№','dir',icoDir()];let e=ext(it.name);if(isImg(it.name))return['е›ѕз‰‡','image',icoImg()];if(['mp3','wav','flac','aac','ogg'].includes(e))return['йџійў‘','audio',icoAud()];if(['mp4','avi','mov','mkv'].includes(e))return['и§†йў‘','video',icoVid()];if(['zip','gz','tar','rar','7z'].includes(e))return['еЋ‹зј©еЊ…','archive',icoArc()];if(isText(it.name))return[e||'ж–‡жњ¬','code',icoCode()];return[e||'ж–‡д»¶','',icoFile()]}function icoDir(){return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 7.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5.5 5H10l2 2h6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 21 9.5v7A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 18.5 19h-13A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 3 16.5v-9Z" fill="#f4b400"/></svg>'}function icoFile(){return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 3h8l4 4v14H6V3Z" fill="#dbe7f5"/><path d="M14 3v5h5" fill="#b8c9dc"/></svg>'}function icoImg(){return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3" fill="#8cc8ff"/><path d="m6 17 4-5 3 3 2-2 3 4H6Z" fill="#1d5fd0"/></svg>'}function icoCode(){return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 3h12v18H6V3Z" fill="#e8edff"/><path d="m10 9-3 3 3 3m4-6 3 3-3 3" stroke="#1d39c4" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>'}function icoAud(){return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 18V7l8-2v11" stroke="#0e7a7a" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="3" fill="#79e1d9"/><circle cx="17" cy="16" r="3" fill="#79e1d9"/></svg>'}function icoVid(){return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2" fill="#ffb4ad"/><path d="m16 10 4-2v8l-4-2v-4Z" fill="#b42318"/></svg>'}function icoArc(){return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 3h12v18H6V3Z" fill="#ffe4a8"/><path d="M10 3h4v10h-4V3Z" fill="#ad6800" opacity=".45"/></svg>'}async function api(url,opt){let r=await fetch(url,opt);let t=await r.text();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(t||r.status);return t}function syncSel(scroll=false){document.querySelectorAll('#rows tr.kb-focus').forEach(r=>r.classList.remove('kb-focus'));if(!kbActive)return;let r=document.querySelector(`#rows tr[data-i="${sel}"]`);if(r){r.classList.add('kb-focus');if(scroll)r.scrollIntoView({block:'nearest',inline:'nearest'})}}function selectIdx(i,scroll=true){if(!items.length){sel=-1;kbActive=false;syncSel(false);return}kbActive=true;sel=(i+items.length)%items.length;let np=Math.floor(sel/pageSize)+1;if(page!==np){page=np;render();setTimeout(()=>syncSel(scroll),0)}else syncSel(scroll)}function moveSel(d){if(!items.length){sel=-1;kbActive=false;syncSel(false);return}if(!kbActive||sel<0||sel>=items.length){kbActive=true;if(sel<0||sel>=items.length)sel=d<0?items.length-1:0;syncSel(true);return}selectIdx(sel+d,true)}function selectedPaths(){return [...selected].filter(p=>p&&items.some(it=>full(it)===p&&!it.root))}function updateSelbar(){let n=selectedPaths().length,b=el('selbar');if(b){b.className='selectionbar '+(multi||n||clip.length?'active':'');el('selCount').textContent=n+' йЎ№е·ІйЂ‰'}let mb=el('multiBtn');if(mb)mb.textContent=multi?'еЏ–ж¶€е¤љйЂ‰':'е¤љйЂ‰';let pb=el('pasteBtn');if(pb)pb.disabled=!clip.length}function toggleMulti(force){multi=force===undefined?!multi:!!force;if(!multi)selected.clear();render()}function clearSelection(){selected.clear();multi=false;render()}function togglePick(p,on){if(on)selected.add(p);else selected.delete(p);multi=true;updateSelbar();syncSel(false)}function selectAllItems(){multi=true;selected.clear();items.forEach(it=>{if(!it.root)selected.add(full(it))});render()}function focusedPath(){return items.length&&sel>=0&&sel<items.length&&!items[sel].root?full(items[sel]):''}function selectedOrFocused(){let ps=selectedPaths(),fp=focusedPath();return ps.length?ps:(fp?[fp]:[])}function render(){let total=items.length,tp=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(total/pageSize));if(total&&kbActive&&sel<0)sel=0;if(sel>=total)sel=total-1;if(!total)sel=-1;if(page>tp)page=tp;let start=(page-1)*pageSize,show=items.slice(start,start+pageSize),h='';el('rows').className=multi?'multi':'';show.forEach((it,local)=>{let i=start+local,p=full(it),k=kind(it),picked=selected.has(p),disabled=it.root?'disabled':'';h+=`<tr data-i='${i}' class='${kbActive&&i===sel?'kb-focus':''}'><td><div class='name-cell'><input class='pick' type='checkbox' data-act='toggle' data-i='${i}' ${picked?'checked':''} ${disabled}><span class='file-icon'>${k[2]}</span><div class='name-meta'><button class='name-title' data-act='open' data-i='${i}'>${esc(it.name)}</button><span class='name-sub'>/${esc(p)}</span></div></div></td><td><span class='chip ${k[1]}'>${k[0]}</span></td><td>${it.dir?'-':fmt(it.size)}</td><td><div class='actions'><button class='btn-secondary' data-act='open' data-i='${i}'>ж‰“ејЂ</button>`;if(!it.root){if(!it.dir){h+=`<a class='btn' href='/webfm/download?path=${enc(p)}'>дё‹иЅЅ</a>`}h+=`<button class='btn-secondary' data-act='rename' data-i='${i}'>ж”№еђЌ</button><button class='btn-secondary' data-act='copy' data-i='${i}'>е¤Ќе€¶</button><button class='btn-secondary' data-act='move' data-i='${i}'>з§»еЉЁ</button><button class='btn-danger' data-act='delete' data-i='${i}'>е€ й™¤</button>`}h+=`</div></td></tr>`});el('rows').innerHTML=h||"<tr><td colspan='4' class='hint'>ж­¤ж–‡д»¶е¤№дёєз©єгЂ‚</td></tr>";el('pageInfo').textContent=`е…± ${total} йЎ№ / жЇЏйЎµ ${pageSize} йЎ№ / з¬¬ ${page}/${tp}`;pager(tp);status(total+' йЎ№');updateSelbar()}function pager(tp){let html=`<button ${page<=1?'disabled':''} onclick='goPage(1)'>й¦–йЎµ</button><button ${page<=1?'disabled':''} onclick='goPage(page-1)'>дёЉдёЂйЎµ</button>`;let b=Math.max(1,page-2),e=Math.min(tp,page+2);for(let p=b;p<=e;p++)html+=`<button class='${p===page?'active':''}' onclick='goPage(${p})'>${p}</button>`;html+=`<button ${page>=tp?'disabled':''} onclick='goPage(page+1)'>дё‹дёЂйЎµ</button><button ${page>=tp?'disabled':''} onclick='goPage(${tp})'>жњ«йЎµ</button>`;el('topPager').innerHTML=tp>1?html:'';el('bottomPager').innerHTML=tp>1?html:''}function goPage(p){page=p;if(items.length)sel=Math.min((page-1)*pageSize,items.length-1);render();syncSel(true)}async function load(){let ac=new AbortController(),to=setTimeout(()=>ac.abort(),12000);try{status('ж­ЈењЁеЉ иЅЅ...');let r=await fetch('/webfm/list?dir='+enc(dir),{signal:ac.signal});if(!r.ok)throw new Error(await r.text()||r.status);let j=await r.json();items=j.items||[];items.sort((a,b)=>b.dir-a.dir||a.name.localeCompare(b.name));if(items.length&&kbActive&&sel<0)sel=0;if(sel>=items.length)sel=items.length-1;el('path').textContent='/' + dir;history.replaceState(null,'','/webfm'+(dir?'?dir='+enc(dir):''));render()}catch(e){status(e&&e.name==='AbortError'?'еЉ иЅЅи¶…ж—¶':e.message,true)}finally{clearTimeout(to)}}function up(){if(!dir){location='/';return}let i=dir.lastIndexOf('/');dir=i>0?dir.slice(0,i):'';page=1;sel=-1;kbActive=false;selected.clear();multi=false;closeEdit();load()}function openMkdirModal(){el('dirname').value='';el('mkdir_modal').classList.add('active');setTimeout(()=>el('dirname').focus(),80)}function closeMkdirModal(){el('mkdir_modal').classList.remove('active')}function openFileModal(){el('filename').value='';el('file_modal').classList.add('active');setTimeout(()=>el('filename').focus(),80)}function closeFileModal(){el('file_modal').classList.remove('active')}function openUploadModal(){el('file').value='';el('uploadStatus').textContent='';el('upload_modal').classList.add('active')}function closeUploadModal(){el('upload_modal').classList.remove('active')}async function mkdir(){let n=el('dirname').value.trim();if(!n)return;try{await api('/webfm/mkdir?dir='+enc(dir)+'&name='+enc(n));closeMkdirModal();load()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}async function newFile(){let n=el('filename').value.trim();if(!n)return;try{await api('/webfm/newfile?dir='+enc(dir)+'&name='+enc(n));closeFileModal();load()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}const UP_CHUNK=65536,upSleep=ms=>new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,ms));async function uploadFetch(url,body,name){let last='';for(let t=0;t<4;t++){try{let r=await fetch(url,{method:'POST',body});if(r.ok)return;last=await r.text()||r.status}catch(e){last=e.message||String(e)}await upSleep(350*(t+1))}throw new Error(name+': '+last)}async function uploadOne(f,i,n){if(f.size===0){await uploadFetch('/webfm/upload?dir='+enc(dir)+'&name='+enc(f.name)+'&offset=0&total=0',new Blob([]),f.name);return}for(let off=0;off<f.size;off+=UP_CHUNK){let end=Math.min(f.size,off+UP_CHUNK),part=f.slice(off,end),pct=Math.floor(end*100/f.size);el('uploadStatus').textContent=`ж­ЈењЁдёЉдј  (${i+1}/${n}) ${pct}% ${f.name}`;await uploadFetch('/webfm/upload?dir='+enc(dir)+'&name='+enc(f.name)+'&offset='+off+'&total='+f.size,part,f.name);await upSleep(30)}}async function upload(){let fs=[...el('file').files];if(!fs.length)return;try{let ok=0;for(let i=0;i<fs.length;i++){await uploadOne(fs[i],i,fs.length);ok++;await upSleep(180)}el('uploadStatus').textContent=`дёЉдј е®Њж€ђпјљ${ok}/${fs.length}`;setTimeout(()=>{closeUploadModal();load()},500)}catch(e){status(e.message,true);el('uploadStatus').textContent=e.message}}async function del(p){try{if(!confirm('зЎ®е®ље€ й™¤ '+p+' еђ—пјџ'))return;await api('/webfm/delete',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:'path='+enc(p)});load()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}async function ren(p){try{let n=prompt('ж–°еђЌз§°',p.split('/').pop());if(!n)return;await api('/webfm/rename',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:'path='+enc(p)+'&name='+enc(n)});load()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}function cp(p){openMoveModal(p,p.split('/').pop(),'copy')}async function deletePaths(ps){let ok=0,fail=0,last='';for(let p of ps){try{await api('/webfm/delete',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:'path='+enc(p)});ok++}catch(e){fail++;last=e.message||String(e)}}return{ok,fail,last}}async function deleteSelected(){let ps=selectedOrFocused();if(!ps.length){status('иЇ·йЂ‰ж‹©йЎ№з›®');return}if(!confirm('зЎ®е®ље€ й™¤ж‰ЂйЂ‰ '+ps.length+' йЎ№?'))return;try{let r=await deletePaths(ps);selected.clear();multi=false;await load();status(r.fail?`е·Іе€ й™¤ ${r.ok} йЎ№пјЊе¤±иґҐ ${r.fail} йЎ№`:`е·Іе€ й™¤ ${r.ok} йЎ№`)}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}function copySelected(cut=false){let ps=selectedOrFocused();if(!ps.length){status('иЇ·йЂ‰ж‹©йЎ№з›®');return}clip=ps.slice();clipMode=cut?'move':'copy';status((cut?'е·Іе‰Єе€‡ ':'е·Іе¤Ќе€¶ ')+clip.length+' йЎ№');updateSelbar()}async function pasteClip(){if(!clip.length){status('е‰Єиґґжќїдёєз©є');updateSelbar();return}try{let op=clipMode==='move'?'/webfm/move':'/webfm/copy',ok=0,fail=0,last='';for(let p of clip){try{await api(op,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:'path='+enc(p)+'&dest='+enc(dir)});ok++}catch(e){fail++;last=e.message||String(e)}}if(clipMode==='move'&&!fail)clip=[];selected.clear();multi=false;await load();status(fail?`е·Іе®Њж€ђ ${ok} йЎ№пјЊе¤±иґҐ ${fail} йЎ№`:'зІиґґе®Њж€ђ')}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}finally{updateSelbar()}}function selectMoveDir(d){moveSelectedDir=d;document.querySelectorAll('#move_modal .tree-label.selected').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('selected'));if(d==='')el('treeRootLabel').classList.add('selected');el('movePath').textContent='/' + d}async function openMoveModal(p,name,mode='move'){moveTarget=p;moveSelectedDir='';moveMode=mode==='copy'?'copy':'move';el('moveName').textContent=name;el('moveTitle').textContent=moveMode==='copy'?'е¤Ќе€¶':'з§»еЉЁ';el('moveConfirm').textContent=moveMode==='copy'?'зЎ®и®¤е¤Ќе€¶':'зЎ®и®¤з§»еЉЁ';selectMoveDir('');el('move_modal').classList.add('active');await loadTree(el('treeRoot'),'')}function closeMoveModal(){el('move_modal').classList.remove('active');moveTarget='';moveMode='move'}async function loadTree(c,d){c.innerHTML='<span class="hint">еЉ иЅЅдё­...</span>';try{let r=await fetch('/webfm/dirtree?dir='+enc(d));let j=await r.json(),dirs=j.dirs||[];c.innerHTML='';if(!dirs.length){c.innerHTML='<span class="hint">(з©є)</span>';return}dirs.forEach(name=>{let fp=d?d+'/'+name:name,n=document.createElement('div'),l=document.createElement('div'),ch=document.createElement('div');l.className='tree-label';l.innerHTML='<span class="tree-arrow">&#9654;</span><span>'+esc(name)+'</span>';ch.className='tree-children';ch.style.display='none';let loaded=false;l.onclick=async e=>{e.stopPropagation();selectMoveDir(fp);l.classList.add('selected');if(!loaded){loaded=true;await loadTree(ch,fp)}let vis=ch.style.display!=='none';ch.style.display=vis?'none':'block';l.querySelector('.tree-arrow').innerHTML=vis?'&#9654;':'&#9660;'};n.appendChild(l);n.appendChild(ch);c.appendChild(n)})}catch(e){c.innerHTML='<span class="err">еЉ иЅЅе¤±иґҐ</span>'}}async function confirmMove(){if(!moveTarget)return;try{let op=moveMode==='copy'?'/webfm/copy':'/webfm/move';await api(op,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'},body:'path='+enc(moveTarget)+'&dest='+enc(moveSelectedDir)});closeMoveModal();load()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}function openItem(it){if(!it)return;let p=full(it);if(it.dir){dir=p;page=1;sel=-1;kbActive=false;selected.clear();multi=false;closeEdit();load()}else if(isImg(it.name))location='/webfm/imgview?path='+enc(p)+'&dir='+enc(dir);else if(isText(it.name))edit(p);else location='/webfm/download?path='+enc(p)}function openSelected(){if(!items.length)return;if(!kbActive||sel<0){kbActive=true;sel=sel>=0?sel:0;syncSel(true);return}openItem(items[sel])}async function edit(p){try{editPath=p;el('editName').textContent=p;let r=await fetch('/webfm/read?path='+enc(p));let t=await r.text();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(t||r.status);let code=r.headers.get('X-Text-Encoding')||'UTF-8';el('editEncoding').textContent='зј–з Ѓ: '+code+(code.startsWith('UTF-8')?'':'пјЊдїќе­еђЋиЅ¬дёє UTF-8');el('editText').value=t;el('editor').classList.add('active');el('editText').focus()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}async function saveEdit(){try{let r=await fetch('/webfm/save?path='+enc(editPath),{method:'POST',body:el('editText').value});if(!r.ok)throw new Error(await r.text()||r.status);status('е·Ідїќе­ '+editPath);load()}catch(e){status(e.message,true)}}function closeEdit(){editPath='';el('editor').classList.remove('active');el('editText').value='';el('editEncoding').textContent=''}document.getElementById('rows').onclick=e=>{let b=e.target.closest('[data-act]');if(!b)return;let i=+b.dataset.i,it=items[i];if(!it)return;let p=full(it),a=b.dataset.act;sel=i;syncSel(false);if(a==='toggle'){togglePick(p,b.checked);return}if(a==='open')openItem(it);else if(a==='delete')del(p);else if(a==='rename')ren(p);else if(a==='copy')cp(p);else if(a==='move')openMoveModal(p,it.name)};document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{let k=e.key,tag=(e.target&&e.target.tagName)||'',ctrl=e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey,lk=k.toLowerCase();if(el('editor').classList.contains('active')){if(k==='Escape'){e.preventDefault();closeEdit()}else if(ctrl&&lk==='s'){e.preventDefault();saveEdit()}return}if(document.querySelector('.modal-overlay.active')){if(k==='Escape'){e.preventDefault();closeMkdirModal();closeFileModal();closeUploadModal();closeMoveModal()}return}if(tag==='INPUT'||tag==='TEXTAREA')return;if(ctrl&&lk==='a'){e.preventDefault();selectAllItems()}else if(ctrl&&lk==='c'){e.preventDefault();copySelected(false)}else if(ctrl&&lk==='x'){e.preventDefault();copySelected(true)}else if(ctrl&&lk==='v'){e.preventDefault();pasteClip()}else if(k==='Delete'){e.preventDefault();deleteSelected()}else if(k===' '&&multi&&items[sel]&&!items[sel].root){e.preventDefault();let p=full(items[sel]);togglePick(p,!selected.has(p));render()}else if(k==='ArrowUp'||k==='ArrowLeft'){e.preventDefault();moveSel(-1)}else if(k==='ArrowDown'||k==='ArrowRight'){e.preventDefault();moveSel(1)}else if(k==='Enter'){e.preventDefault();openSelected()}else if(k==='Escape'){e.preventDefault();if(multi||selected.size)clearSelection();else up()}});load();</script></div></body></html>␀␀␀М„HР„HФ„HШ„H Ѓ#H8oHа„Hи„Hађ&HР5Hм„Hр„Hф„HЊ}H|}Hђ}Hш„Hь„H…H…H$…H@…HP…Hp…Hђ…HЁ…HА…HШ…Hр…H␀†H†H0…H0…HэH†HT†HЊ†Hё†Hр†H,‡HT‡Ht‡H”‡HЌH<ЌH¤‡H°‡HА‡HlіHР‡HР‡HШ‡H„ЮHа‡Hр‡Hш‡H€HшэH€H€H(€H4